G、知识库、Agent 工作流、模型评测等优先。\n11.有医疗健康合规、隐私保护、数据安全相关经验优先。\n12.有用户增长、商业化、订阅制产品或企业客户交付经验优先。\n13.英文资料阅读能力较好，能跟进海外 AI 健康产品趋势优先。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科及以上","YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-07-10T12:37:22","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"fb02f33e-39d1-4288-9a26-3cfdccd689db","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":880101098,"PostDateInt":1783472357000,"PostDate":"2026-07-08T08:59:17","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"医务部副主任(J52922)","OrgId":2676103,"Org":"医务部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["江苏省·苏州市·吴江区"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1、负责参与制定全院等级医院建设实施方案、各阶段工作安排及考核要求，起草重要文稿及发文。\n2、深入研究、解读最新版医院评审评价标准（条款），组织开展全院性的评审标准培训与指导工作。\n3、统筹协调各职能部门及临床科室，细化任务分工，指导、督促各部门按计划完成评审条款的准备工作。\n4、组织院内自查、督查及模拟评审活动，发现问题及时反馈，并督促整改，实现医疗质